  "details": "This might be related to the following canny. I do not know.\nhttps://vrchat.canny.io/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/udons-breaking-with-increased-component-use\nWorld: wrld_84b078e0-1eb1-4dfd-8355-5b388c929af6\n\nFor this world, many Udon Components do not work. I am using the exact same script and component in two places with the same references (except a single transform) and one works while the other  does not. Both are never referenced by any other object in the world and are enabled by default. Both allow the interact, but while the TrapDoor (below spawn) does work, the Ladder (outside main door, to the left) shows the interact but doesn't give any click sound which is the first step in the Udon. \n\nAnother issue which might be related, the PlayerMods that allows jumping takes about 15 seconds to actually start. Similarly, none of the Udons work at all until this point. It feels like there is a huge delay until my components actually become network ready and when that happens it doesn't enable all of them properly either, skipping some. \nNow have less UdonBehaviours (only about 800) so i don't know that it's an issue with increased component use anymore.",
